%% Separation of what goes to whom. The source vault never enters an investor package.
flowchart LR
  VAULT[(Founder source vault<br/>RESTRICTED_IP)] --> PROD[Production Engineering Workspace<br/>editable source, DB, API, tests]
  VAULT --> FOUNDER[Founder Studio<br/>founder only, local]
  PROD -- build + gates + verify --> INVPKG[Investor Edition package<br/>no source, no engineering controls]
  PROD -- build + gates --> ENGPKG[Private Engineer Edition<br/>authorized reviewers only]
  INVPKG -. distribution needs owner written approval .-> INVESTORS((Investors))
  ENGPKG -. under NDA .-> REVIEWERS((Technical reviewers))
